From 73978faa3d8eedac1ce616135f7e65583e93ce1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hal Feng <hal.feng@starfivetech.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 10:33:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 31/53] pwm: add OpenCores PTC PWM driver

Add a driver for the single-channel OpenCores PTC block used by StarFive
SoCs. Preserve enabled bootloader state, expose the hardware-only
inverted polarity, and support runtime and system power management.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/linux-pwm/20260714033050.44952-4-hal.feng@starfivetech.com/
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
Signed-off-by: Hal Feng <hal.feng@starfivetech.com>
